      * Subprogram tested through its interface in the in-program copy:
      * RUN USING loads the PROCEDURE DIVISION USING parameters, runs
      * the entry and returns the fields (like a CALL BY REFERENCE).
       TESTSUITE TSTDISCI 'DISCOUNT through its interface (RUN USING)'
       PROGRAM DISCOUNT

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  T-RESULT                  PIC 9(7)V99.
       01  T-CATEGORY                PIC X(10).

       TESTCASE 'premium with a literal as input'
           RUN USING 2000 T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 1600
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'PREMIUM'
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'basic gets no discount'
           RUN USING 100 T-RESULT T-CATEGORY
           EXPECT T-RESULT TO BE NUMERIC 100
           EXPECT T-CATEGORY TO BE 'BASIC'
